{"title": "Carnival", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CarnivalMain.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The main entrance of the Carnival.\" src=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalMain.jpg/320px-CarnivalMain.jpg?3fbe81\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalMain.jpg/480px-CarnivalMain.jpg?3fbe81 1.5x, /images/thumb/CarnivalMain.jpg/640px-CarnivalMain.jpg?3fbe81 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CarnivalMain.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The main entrance of the Carnival.</div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Carnival</b> is a circus and funhouse themed interior added in the <b>Obscurity</b> update. It only spawns commonly on <a href=\"/wiki/Carnate\" title=\"Carnate\">Carnate</a> and has a very rare chance to spawn on any moon.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Rooms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Rooms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Interior_Features\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Interior Features</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Music\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Music</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Carnival_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Carnival Ambience</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Magic_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Magic Ambience</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Other_Features\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Features</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Hazards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Hazards</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Pop_the_Balloons\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pop the Balloons</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Press_the_Nose\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Press the Nose</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Traverse_the_Tightropes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Traverse the Tightropes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Rewards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rewards</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Event:_Colorless_Spiral\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Event: Colorless Spiral</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Colorless_Spiral_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Colorless Spiral Ambience</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Rooms\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Rooms\">&gt; Rooms</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Tent</b> - A yellow and red tent that the main entrance spawns in.</li>\n<li><b>Button Room</b> - A room with a large container and a button that always spawns in the <b>Tent</b>. This is the reward room for the <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objectives</b></a>.</li>\n<li><b>Server Room</b> - A room that can generate in the <b>Tent</b> with server racks and shelves. Scrap can spawn here.</li>\n<li><b>Funhouse</b> - The primary area of the interior with red and white walls and wooden floors. The majority of scrap spawns around the various rooms in cabinets, on tables, etc. It is connected to the <b>Tent</b> through a large doorway with two eyes and the shape of a mouth.</li>\n<li><b>Spinning Tunnel</b> - A catwalk leading into a tunnel that is spinning.</li>\n<li><b>Crystal Ball</b> - Rooms with large crystal balls on center tables or small crystal balls and smaller tables in grated areas. These rooms can generate without a crystal ball on them and commonly have scrap.</li>\n<li><b>Abyss</b> - A long wooden walkway that borders on a massive, pitch black area with practically nothing in it. The <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Traverse_the_Tightropes\"><b>Traverse the Tightropes</b></a> objective spawns here.</li>\n<li><b>Glass Maze</b> - A maze of glass can spawn that leads to the <b>Glass maze trophy</b>, the apparatus of the interior. It weighs 21lbs and is worth \u25ae80. If a player takes it off its pedestal, all apparatus related events will be triggered and the glass floor beneath will start cracking. Players must quickly run off it before it breaks and they fall into the pits that act as quicksand below.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Interior_Features\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Interior_Features\">&gt; Interior Features</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Music\">Music</span></h3>\n<p>Ambient music can be heard playing around the interior. Different music can also play in the <b>Spinning Tunnel</b> and <b>Crystal Ball</b> rooms.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Carnival_Ambience\">Carnival Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"151\" data-mwtitle=\"CircusAmbience2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CircusAmbience2.mp3?a4e9d7\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CircusAmbience2.mp3/CircusAmbience2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Magic_Ambience\">Magic Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"31\" data-mwtitle=\"MagicBallLoop.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/MagicBallLoop.mp3?6a50c7\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/MagicBallLoop.mp3/MagicBallLoop.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Features\">Other Features</span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Broken Door</b> - Some doors fall to the ground after being opened.</li>\n<li><b>Varying Door Sizes</b> - Some doors are large while other doors are small and require players to crouch through them.</li>\n<li><b>Rotating Room</b> - A circular room that periodically spins around, disorientating players and changing where they need to enter or leave through.</li>\n<li><b>Tightropes</b> - A narrow rope can sometimes connect two areas.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Hazards\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Hazards\">&gt; Hazards</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Boxing Glove</b> - A boxing glove can pop out from the floor and punch through a doorway after a door is opened, dealing 100 damage to any player it hits. Depending on the direction players come from, there can be a raised area on the floor that indicates where the glove will pop up from and players can prepare to avoid it. This door will remain open for the rest of the day.</li>\n<li><b>Hammerbot</b> - Small robots with glowing eyes can be found around the interior. Walking into their line of sight will cause them to beep and do an overhead slam with a comically large hammer. This hammer will deal 999 damage to all players it hits. The robot usually misses if a player is as close as possible to it due to the hammer's handle.</li>\n<li><b>Mouth Pit</b> - An opening in the floor with a painting resembling an open mouth that players can fall into</li>\n<li><b>Death Pit</b> - A pit with broken wood platforms for players to walk on to jump over them. Some tiles also have a black floor that gives the illusion of being a death pit while being safe.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Secondary_Objectives\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CarnivalTraverseButton.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalTraverseButton.jpg/320px-CarnivalTraverseButton.jpg?5e52b3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalTraverseButton.jpg/480px-CarnivalTraverseButton.jpg?5e52b3 1.5x, /images/thumb/CarnivalTraverseButton.jpg/640px-CarnivalTraverseButton.jpg?5e52b3 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CarnivalTraverseButton.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The Button Room that holds the reward and masks indicating the Traverse the Tightropes objective spawned.</div></div></div><p>One of three unique objectives will randomly generate for players to complete for one of three valuable rewards that will spawn after pressing the button in the <b>Button Room</b>. \n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pop_the_Balloons\">Pop the Balloons</span></h3>\n<p>If the <b>Button Room</b> has balloons in it, players must find and pop four balloons within the interior with a shovel or knife. After popping a balloon, a sound effect will play to indicate it was popped and <a href=\"/wiki/Confetbees\" title=\"Confetbees\"><b>Confetbees</b></a> will spawn. This is a variant of the Mask Hornets.\n</p><p>Once all four balloons are popped, players can return to and press the button in the <b>Button Room</b> for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Press_the_Nose\">Press the Nose</span></h3>\n<p>If the <b>Button Room</b> has cages in it, players must find a room in the interior with similar cages and a large clown face. Approaching the nose will prompt players to press it, switching the prompt to \"Run\" if pressed. Music will begin playing throughout the whole interior and all players must leave the interior within the next 40 seconds. When time is up, the interior will explode and deal multiple instances of 9,999 damage to all remaining players inside. This also disables the power for the rest of the day.\n</p><p>This explosion can be heard from the exterior and a sound effect will play afterward. Players can now press the button in the <b>Button Room</b> to receive their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Traverse_the_Tightropes\">Traverse the Tightropes</span></h3>\n<p>If the <b>Button Room</b> has masks on the wall, players must make their way to the <b>Abyss</b>. Several wooden pillars, tightropes, and lights will now be in this area. Players must make their way through the maze to the other side and interact with a mask. A jetpack can also be used to get across.\n</p><p>After the mask is interacted with, a sound effect will be heard and players can now return to and press the button in the <b>Button Room</b> for their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Carnival Secondary Rewards\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight</th>\n<th>Base Value</th>\n<th>Value</th>\n<th>Solo Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ruined crystal ball</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ruined_crystal_ball.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Ruined crystal ball.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ruined_crystal_ball.png/60px-Ruined_crystal_ball.png?766ab0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ruined_crystal_ball.png/90px-Ruined_crystal_ball.png?766ab0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ruined_crystal_ball.png/120px-Ruined_crystal_ball.png?766ab0 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>183</td>\n<td>214\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crystal ball</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Crystal_ball.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Crystal ball.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Crystal_ball.png/60px-Crystal_ball.png?8aaa92\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Crystal_ball.png/90px-Crystal_ball.png?8aaa92 1.5x, /images/thumb/Crystal_ball.png/120px-Crystal_ball.png?8aaa92 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>310</td>\n<td>362\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Magnificent crystal ball</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Magnificent_crystal_ball.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Magnificent crystal ball.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Magnificent_crystal_ball.png/60px-Magnificent_crystal_ball.png?71b4df\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Magnificent_crystal_ball.png/90px-Magnificent_crystal_ball.png?71b4df 1.5x, /images/thumb/Magnificent_crystal_ball.png/120px-Magnificent_crystal_ball.png?71b4df 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>482</td>\n<td>563\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>The reward is randomized, but the chance for a more valuable reward is increased by how early in the day players complete the objective and is influenced by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics#Furniture_luck\">the vanilla luck system</a>. The value of the reward is additionally increased by a difficulty multiplier, ranging from 0.6x to 1.4x, and a solo (singleplayer) multiplier of 1.17x. All of Carnival's <b>Secondary Objectives</b> are considered Medium difficulty and have a reward multiplier of 1.15x. The base value and multipliers for objective rewards can be adjusted in the Wesleys Interior Tools config under the Secondary Objectives section.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Event:_Colorless_Spiral\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Event:_Colorless_Spiral\">&gt; Event: Colorless Spiral</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CarnivalColorlessSpiral.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalColorlessSpiral.jpg/320px-CarnivalColorlessSpiral.jpg?7dcfda\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalColorlessSpiral.jpg/480px-CarnivalColorlessSpiral.jpg?7dcfda 1.5x, /images/thumb/CarnivalColorlessSpiral.jpg/640px-CarnivalColorlessSpiral.jpg?7dcfda 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CarnivalColorlessSpiral.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The Colorless Spiral after activation.</div></div></div><p>A small black and white room with a center pillar can randomly spawn somewhere in the <b>Funhouse</b>. If a player enters the room and walks to the other end of it, the room will abruptly start to spin upwards and trap them inside. It will also turn the lights on and begin playing music.\n</p><p>Once the room has spun fully upwards, <a href=\"/wiki/Black_and_White_Confetbees\" title=\"Black and White Confetbees\"><b>Black and White Confetbees</b></a> will spawn. This is a variant of the Mask Hornets that players must avoid. While moving around this room can give the illusion of it spinning, it doesn't start spinning until later when the music gets faster and the room begins to spiral downwards. A second <b>Black and White Confetbees</b> will spawn when the spinning stops. The room will then shortly spin back upwards and a third <b>Black and White Confetbees</b> will spawn after it stops. Finally, the room will quickly spiral all the way back down to the ground floor and spawn the reward. The <b>Black and White Confetbees</b> will be in the interior for the rest of the day.\n</p><p><b>Black and White Confetbees</b> struggle to catch up to players that are weightless and manage their stamina to sprint away in bursts, but will likely collide with players when the room spins them around violently. A general strategy to mitigate this is to move along the edge of the room and group up all the bees before quickly moving to the other side of the room past the center pillar once the room is about to spin. This helps in getting the bees closer to the center pillar to potentially get caught on it or slowed down by it once the spinning starts. Regardless of the strategy used, the event itself is rather forgiving due to the low 10 damage per hit from the bees and the bigger problem is often dealing with the bees in the interior for the rest of the day.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>The current reward for this event is six random scrap from the loot table below.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Reward Table\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Big bolt</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Big_bolt.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Big bolt.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/60px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/90px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/120px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>51.28%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cash register</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cash_register.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Cash register.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Cash_register.png/60px-Cash_register.png?6d480e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Cash_register.png/90px-Cash_register.png?6d480e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Cash_register.png/120px-Cash_register.png?6d480e 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>84</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>20.51%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gold bar</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gold_bar.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gold bar.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Gold_bar.png/60px-Gold_bar.png?818179\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gold_bar.png/90px-Gold_bar.png?818179 1.5x, /images/thumb/Gold_bar.png/120px-Gold_bar.png?818179 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>77</td>\n<td>102</td>\n<td>156</td>\n<td>210</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2.56%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metal sheet</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Metal_sheet.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Metal sheet.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Metal_sheet.png/60px-Metal_sheet.png?567eb9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Metal_sheet.png/90px-Metal_sheet.png?567eb9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Metal_sheet.png/120px-Metal_sheet.png?567eb9 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>25.64%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Colorless_Spiral_Ambience\">Colorless Spiral Ambience</span></h3>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"48\" data-mwtitle=\"WeirdCarouselAmbient.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/WeirdCarouselAmbient.mp3?5a04b4\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/WeirdCarouselAmbient.mp3/WeirdCarouselAmbient.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CarnivalTent.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A room in the Tent.\"><img alt=\"A room in the Tent.\" src=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalTent.jpg/120px-CarnivalTent.jpg?a2dd08\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalTent.jpg/180px-CarnivalTent.jpg?a2dd08 1.5x, /images/thumb/CarnivalTent.jpg/240px-CarnivalTent.jpg?a2dd08 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A room in the Tent.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CarnivalServers.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A Server Room.\"><img alt=\"A Server Room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalServers.jpg/120px-CarnivalServers.jpg?16a593\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/CarnivalServers.jpg/180px-CarnivalServers.jpg?16a593 1.5x, /images/thumb/CarnivalServers.jpg/240px-CarnivalServers.jpg?16a593 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A Server Room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Carni